Method
------
HyDE: Gao, Ma, Lin, Callan. "Precise Zero-Shot Dense Retrieval without Relevance
Labels." ACL 2023. arXiv:2212.10496. This repository re-implements the method from
the paper; it contains no code from the official repository (which has no licence).
The per-dataset instructions in configs/hyde_instructions.yaml are quoted from the
paper's Appendix A.1 for reproduction.

BEIR datasets (downloaded by scripts/download_beir.py, not redistributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Licences as reported by the BEIR paper (Thakur et al., 2021, Appendix E) and the HyDE
paper (Appendix A.3). The two sources disagree on some versions; check the original
dataset pages before reuse.
  - SciFact (Wadden et al., 2020): CC BY-NC 2.0 (BEIR) / CC BY-NC 4.0 (HyDE paper)
  - TREC-COVID / CORD-19: CORD-19 Dataset License Agreement
  - ArguAna (Wachsmuth et al., 2018): CC BY 4.0 (BEIR) / CC BY-SA 3.0 (HyDE paper)

cache/beir/ contains LLM-generated hypothetical documents. They are model outputs
derived from these datasets' queries. They contain no query or corpus text and are
shared for reproducibility only; any reuse should also respect the dataset licences above.

